WEBVTT

caption-plan.phantom-traffic.v1.hook-1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.767 line:78% position:50% align:center
The cars move forward.

caption-plan.phantom-traffic.v1.hook-2
00:00:01.767 --> 00:00:04.200 line:78% position:50% align:center
But a traffic jam can move backward.

caption-plan.phantom-traffic.v1.experiment-1
00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:06.400 line:78% position:50% align:center
Researchers put twenty-two cars

caption-plan.phantom-traffic.v1.experiment-2
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.800 line:78% position:50% align:center
on a circular track.

caption-plan.phantom-traffic.v1.experiment-3
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.133 line:78% position:50% align:center
No obstruction.

caption-plan.phantom-traffic.v1.experiment-4
00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:11.567 line:78% position:50% align:center
Yet stop-and-go traffic formed.

caption-plan.phantom-traffic.v1.mechanism-1
00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:13.400 line:78% position:50% align:center
In dense traffic,

caption-plan.phantom-traffic.v1.mechanism-2
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.967 line:78% position:50% align:center
small speed changes can sometimes grow

caption-plan.phantom-traffic.v1.mechanism-3
00:00:15.967 --> 00:00:18.600 line:78% position:50% align:center
as drivers adjust to the cars ahead.

caption-plan.phantom-traffic.v1.membership-1
00:00:18.967 --> 00:00:21.333 line:78% position:50% align:center
Cars join the slow patch at the back

caption-plan.phantom-traffic.v1.membership-2
00:00:21.333 --> 00:00:22.833 line:78% position:50% align:center
and leave at the front.

caption-plan.phantom-traffic.v1.payoff-1
00:00:23.267 --> 00:00:24.633 line:78% position:50% align:center
The cars change.

caption-plan.phantom-traffic.v1.payoff-2
00:00:24.633 --> 00:00:26.567 line:78% position:50% align:center
The pattern moves backward.

caption-plan.phantom-traffic.v1.ending-1
00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:30.200 line:78% position:50% align:center
Not every jam starts this way.

caption-plan.phantom-traffic.v1.ending-2
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.900 line:78% position:50% align:center
But this kind needs no blocked road.
